cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "scireport: a data-centric scientific report engine"
abstract: >-
  scireport turns one data file (a report bundle with a manifest, tables, figures and text),
  one template (structure) and one layout (look) into Markdown, HTML, LaTeX and PDF, and with
  pandoc into Word, OpenDocument and EPUB. The data file is the contract: it carries its
  specification version, the built-in templates and layouts are frozen per version, and the same
  inputs give byte-identical Markdown, HTML and LaTeX.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Cardoso
    given-names: N. M.
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2238-9665"
version: 1.0.0
license: GPL-3.0-only
